; Split-horizon zone for ca.peetvandesande.com.
;
; This name exists publicly as a CNAME to an OVH VPS. Inside the lab it must
; resolve to pistis instead, because that is what serves the CRL and AIA files
; named in the G3 intermediate certificate - see homelab/ca.
;
; The zone is deliberately the SINGLE NAME, not peetvandesande.com. Taking the
; whole domain would shadow mail, www and everything else in it with an empty
; internal zone, and break them for the entire LAN.
;
; peetvandesande.com is DNSSEC-signed, so this override needs a matching
; addNTA() on Delphi or every lookup here SERVFAILs. See delphi's recursor.lua.
;
; Bump the serial on every edit, then:
;   pdns_control bind-reload-now ca.peetvandesande.com
$TTL 3600
$ORIGIN ca.peetvandesande.com.

@       IN  SOA pythia.home. hostmaster.home. (
                2026091001  ; serial
                3600        ; refresh
                900         ; retry
                604800      ; expire
                3600 )      ; negative TTL

@       IN  NS      pythia.home.

@       IN  A       192.168.1.55     ; pistis - serves /g3/ over plain HTTP
